'' AN ANDROID LINK WITH NO USABLE NDK IS TKO0111, naming what was looked at: a variable that points
'' somewhere with no prebuilt sysroot is reported, not skipped for the next candidate (D-A1-4).
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TIKO_ANDROID_NDK=build/.no-such-ndk
'' ARGS: -target android-x86_64 tests/driver/src/no-fbrt0.bas -p tests/driver/src/elfgroup -o build/.no-such-ndk-out
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 5
'' EXPECT-OUT: TKO0111
'' EXPECT-OUT: TIKO_ANDROID_NDK is 'build/.no-such-ndk'
'' EXPECT-NO-FILE: build/.no-such-ndk-out
